{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1738972800, "end_date": 1739577599, "month_true_total": 128, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:11 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "187897318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090656457", "personaname": "TATAPA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090656457/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 10761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7435, "last_played": 1741380429, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "cool", "timestamp_created": 1739552927, "timestamp_updated": 1739552927, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187889200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026782951", "personaname": "Yüce Ebu Leheb", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/grimmaydie/", "num_games_owned": 539, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 164, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 129, "last_played": 1739552739, "avatar": "b8d0f9505c597958568f2074c00f5d8878e7e721"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is like the Dragon Age Veilguard to the Mass Effect series.", "timestamp_created": 1739545338, "timestamp_updated": 1739545338, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.4541034996509552", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187886158", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026640986", "personaname": "𝔸𝕥𝕣𝕚 (𝟜)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/atrithau/", "num_games_owned": 549, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 87, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 87, "last_played": 1739516954, "avatar": "bc0da31d15364cac7c6c310b42b0f554d4ea2334"}, "language": "english", "review": "From what I’ve read, the game supposedly comes together around the 10-hour mark, but I’m not willing to go that far given how bland it’s been. I don’t know if the writing is bad so much as it is safe and uninspired. The art direction is an even bigger issue in how much it diverges from the trilogy. It’s also oddly goofy—realistic-looking suits clash with aliens that feel like they came out of a bad vintage comic book.\n\nThe first level alone left me reeling from boredom. There are elements that work in isolation, and the animations aren’t nearly as bad as its reputation suggests, but it’s clear this is one of those games with large open areas filled with busywork of zero value. \n\nEnemy sponginess drags out encounters way beyond what they should last, and this is also what got me to break and refund. If it’s this bad on normal, I don’t want to imagine how much worse it gets on higher difficulties. Maybe it improves later in a major way, but I won’t be there to find out.", "timestamp_created": 1739542340, "timestamp_updated": 1739542340, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187883649", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006095627", "personaname": "hex0space", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Heroin_Hilz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 7424, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7424, "last_played": 1739539140, "avatar": "59305ce329204cff4d0370a0ce4f1bd025758cec"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a fan of ME Series and played through it countless times. The Story is good, but the Missions are tedious, sending you around the whole map (on a world or in a cluster) just to scan some stuff... Character design of humans and asari is just awefull, animations are just bad... This could be a great start of a series, but they fckd up on a lot details, so it's  just like death by 1000 cuts.", "timestamp_created": 1739539570, "timestamp_updated": 1739539570, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187866959", "author": {"steamid": "76561199135714825", "personaname": "Kailt95", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199135714825/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4307, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4263, "deck_playtime_at_review": 4263, "last_played": 1739757638, "avatar": "e15cc8a3042e2d587c062a3dabbe98ce684920e4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really enjoyed the game overall!", "timestamp_created": 1739514725, "timestamp_updated": 1739514725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}